WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.800
Guile begins a raw Drive Rush toward standing Manon.

2
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:01.150
Standing medium punch connects out of Rush.

3
00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:02.350
The back-heavy target follow-up connects.

4
00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:03.650
Heavy-punch Hurricane launches the opponent.

5
00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:04.700
Sonic Hurricane keeps Manon airborne near the wall.

6
00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:05.750
OD Flash Kick continues the juggle.

7
00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:05.950
The OD kick sends Manon back toward the corner floor.
